{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No, Non, Not!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'<i>No door can Not be opened with a Non-black key</i>' is a rule-modifying 2D action puzzle game in which the protagonist, who has the power to manipulate the word \u2018<i>Nai</i>(no/non/not)\u2019, adventures through a world created by rule sentences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by a goddess, the protagonist is given the ability to manipulate negation and must solve a number of stages in order to rescue the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/780d94f6afa82c32ba8fb8e686e225dc.avif?t=1748233478\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras_big/780d94f6afa82c32ba8fb8e686e225dc.avif?t=1748233478 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can use the given ability to retrieve the negative word \u2018<i>Nai</i>\u2019 from a rule statement and then add it to other rule statements.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/7928311c58ca34d9c5787dcf147c62ae.avif?t=1748233478\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras_big/7928311c58ca34d9c5787dcf147c62ae.avif?t=1748233478 width=800 height=500 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/61e28f05f4d3ee444cdb790bf81e3e12.avif?t=1748233478\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras_big/61e28f05f4d3ee444cdb790bf81e3e12.avif?t=1748233478 width=800 height=500 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https